    "https://www.ntnu.edu/vacancies": {
      "title": "Navigation",
      "description": "Vacancies - NTNU Navigation Skip to Content NTNU Home ntnu.edu Search Menu Studies Master's programmes in English For exchange students PhD opportunities All programmes of study Courses Financing Language requirements Application process Academic calendar FAQ Research and innovation NTNU research Research excellence Strategic research areas Innovation resources PhD opportunities Life and housing Student in Trondheim Student in Gjøvik Student in Ålesund For researchers Life and housing About NTNU Contact us Faculties and departments Libraries International researcher support Vacancies About NTNU Maps Vacancies Språkvelger Norsk Vacancies Ledige stillinger - Jumbotron bilde Vacancies at NTNU At NTNU, we work for something bigger than ourselves. Our mission is clear: To create knowledge for a better world. When you join NTNU, you contribute to research, education, and innovation that make a real difference – locally, nationally, and globally. We welcome people with diverse skills and backgrounds. At NTNU, you’ll find exciting positions in research and teaching, as well as technical and administrative roles that keep everything running. Whatever your job, you help build solutions for the future, from groundbreaking technology to sustainable societies. You’ll be part of a university that is constantly evolving. We focus on digitalization, green transition, and international collaboration. Our strategy is about driving change and taking responsibility for the future. Together with strong academic communities and modern infrastructure, we give you the space to grow and succeed. Vacancies - Icon row Working at NTNU Employee benefits Competence development and courses Application process Vacancies Portlet Vacancies Location Faculty Position Stipendiat i allmennmedisin: Teammodeller for muskel- og skjeletthelse på fastlegekontoret Stipendiat i allmennmedisin: Teammodeller for muskel- og skjeletthelse på fastlegekontoret - Institutt for samfunnsmedisin og sykepleie Trondheim Engagement 2. sep 2026 Eksamensvakter til digital eksamen ved NTNU Eksamensvakter til digital eksamen ved NTNU - Seksjon for læringsstøtte og digitale tjenester Trondheim - 5. sep 2026 PhD Candidate in Agentic AI for Intelligent Control of Floating Multi-modular Structures PhD Candidate in Agentic AI for Intelligent Control of Floating Multi-modular Structures - Institutt for marin teknikk Trondheim Temporary 7. sep 2026 Researcher in in the design of new timber products using reclaimed timber Researcher in in the design of new timber products using reclaimed timber - Institutt for vareproduksjon og byggteknikk Gjøvik Temporary 8. sep 2026 Prosjektcontroller Prosjektcontroller - Fakultetsadministrasjonen Trondheim Permanent 9. sep 2026 PhD Candidate in Laser-Induced Graphene (LIG) Sensors for Composite Materials PhD Candidate in Laser-Induced Graphene (LIG) Sensors for Composite Materials - Institutt for vareproduksjon og byggteknikk Gjøvik Temporary 10. sep 2026 PhD Candidate in RF/antenna design for GNSS reflectometry from small satellites PhD Candidate in RF/antenna design for GNSS reflectometry from small satellites - Institutt for elektroniske systemer Trondheim Temporary 10. sep 2026 Postdoctoral Fellow at the language acquisition and language processing lab Postdoctoral Fellow at the language acquisition and language processing lab - Institutt for språk og litteratur Trondheim Fixed term 10. sep 2026 Postdoctoral Fellow in Process Metallurgy Postdoctoral Fellow in Process Metallurgy - Institutt for materialteknologi Trondheim Fixed term 10. sep 2026 Show all vacancies Vacancies - practical information links Practical information New at NTNU Housing International Researcher Support Learn Norwegian Campus maps Salary NTNU – Norwegian University of Science and Technology For employees | For students | Intranet | Canvas Studies Studies Master's programmes in English For exchange students PhD opportunities Courses Career development Continuing